<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa, coffee higher AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa, coffee higher AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Moves higher in line with pre-opening expectations after NY rise. Sept up 16 stg at 1,036 stg a tonne at 1000 GMT, eyes 1,039 support.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Reverses from Monday's spec sell-off to trade higher as expected. Nov up $37 at $1,520.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Barely traded. The only traded contract August was down cents at $326.00.</p>
</text>
